      "experiment_id": "exp_1",
      "description": "Community detection on a denoised transaction graph using a Coherent Ising Machine (CIM) to solve a QUBO/Ising formulation of modularity maximization, evaluated at 8-bit and 14-bit QUBO encoding precision.",
      "algorithm": {
        "family": "qubo",
        "variant": "Modularity-maximization QUBO solved via Ising ground-state search on a Coherent Ising Machine",
